{"seq":2,"slug":"gqa-adoption","title":"主流模型采用：Llama、Mistral 与收敛的 8","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/grouped-query-attention/practice/gqa-adoption","wordCount":1882,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"主流模型采用-llama-mistral-与收敛的-8\">主流模型采用：Llama、Mistral 与收敛的 8</h1><p>要验证前面所有关于「G=8 是甜点」的论述，最直接的证据不在论文里，而在主流开源模型的配置文件里。翻开采用全注意力的模型——Llama、Mistral、Qwen 主系、Gemma——它们的 <code>config.json</code> 里 <code>num_attention_heads</code> 与 <code>num_key_value_heads</code> 几乎无一例外地讲着同一个故事：查询头保持满数，KV 头收敛到 8。这一篇盘点真实数字，看不同团队如何独立走到同一个答案；同时也要直面 2025–2026 年正在改变图景的两条分叉线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-读配置定位注意力方案\">核心概念：读配置定位注意力方案</h2><p>如 <a href=\"../foundations/mha-mqa-gqa\">MHA/MQA/GQA 谱系</a> 所述，<code>num_attention_heads</code> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<code>num_key_value_heads</code> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，两者相除是组大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>。相等是 MHA，后者为 1 是 MQA，介于之间是 GQA。用这把尺子扫过 2026 年的旗舰开源模型，会看到一个清晰的收敛：几乎所有中大型模型都是 GQA，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反复落在 8。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[2023: Llama 2 70B&lt;br/&gt;首个旗舰 GQA] --&gt; B[2024: Llama 3 全系&lt;br/&gt;Mistral/Mixtral]&#10;  B --&gt; C[2025: Qwen2/2.5&lt;br/&gt;Gemma 2]&#10;  C --&gt; D[2026: Llama 4&lt;br/&gt;几乎全部旗舰]&#10;  A --&gt; E[n_kv 收敛到 8]&#10;  B --&gt; E&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; F[前沿分叉一: DeepSeek MLA&lt;br/&gt;低秩压缩另辟蹊径]&#10;  D --&gt; G[前沿分叉二: hybrid 线性注意力&lt;br/&gt;Qwen3-Next 与 Kimi Linear&lt;br/&gt;全注意力层占比压至约四分之一]\">flowchart TD\n  A[2023: Llama 2 70B&lt;br/&gt;首个旗舰 GQA] --&gt; B[2024: Llama 3 全系&lt;br/&gt;Mistral/Mixtral]\n  B --&gt; C[2025: Qwen2/2.5&lt;br/&gt;Gemma 2]\n  C --&gt; D[2026: Llama 4&lt;br/&gt;几乎全部旗舰]\n  A --&gt; E[n_kv 收敛到 8]\n  B --&gt; E\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; F[前沿分叉一: DeepSeek MLA&lt;br/&gt;低秩压缩另辟蹊径]\n  D --&gt; G[前沿分叉二: hybrid 线性注意力&lt;br/&gt;Qwen3-Next 与 Kimi Linear&lt;br/&gt;全注意力层占比压至约四分之一]</pre><p>这条时间线里最值得注意的是收敛的独立性：Meta、Mistral、阿里、Google 各自独立设计，却都停在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv}=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>。这不是互相抄袭，而是 <a href=\"../mechanism/group-dimensions\">分组维度选择</a> 里那组约束（整除、张量并行、质量下限、收益递减）的交集本就狭窄，8 几乎是唯一同时满足的落点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"真实配置数字盘点\">真实配置数字盘点</h2><p>下表汇总据公开配置与技术报告整理的主流模型注意力配置（数字随版本可能微调，趋势稳定）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（查询头）</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（KV 头）</th>\n<th>组大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>缓存相对 MHA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Llama 2 70B</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1/8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Llama 3 / 3.1 70B</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1/8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Llama 3.1 8B</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mistral 7B</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mixtral 8x7B</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qwen2 / 2.5 系列</td>\n<td>视规模</td>\n<td>多为 8 或 4</td>\n<td>4–8</td>\n<td>1/4–1/8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gemma 2 系列</td>\n<td>视规模</td>\n<td>GQA 配置</td>\n<td>2–8</td>\n<td>1/4–1/16</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>几个可读性要点。其一，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv}=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 是绝对主流，无论 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 32 还是 64——大模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q=64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 时组大小 8，中模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q=32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span> 时组大小 4，两者都落在 <a href=\"../tradeoffs/gqa-ablations\">消融与经验规律</a> 说的「组大小 4–8」区间。其二，Mixtral 这类 MoE 模型的注意力层同样用 GQA——GQA 与专家混合是正交的两套效率手段，可叠加。其三，越小的模型有时组大小取得更保守（偏 4），印证「小模型对共享更敏感」的法则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-llama-2-70b-先动手\">为什么 Llama 2 70B 先动手</h2><p>一个耐人寻味的历史细节：GQA 首先落地在 Llama 2 的 70B 版本，而非同期更小的 7B/13B（后者仍用 MHA）。这不是巧合，而是 <a href=\"../tradeoffs/gqa-ablations\">消融与经验规律</a> 法则二的直接体现——大模型头冗余更多、对共享更不敏感，Meta 在最大的模型上最有信心承受共享 K/V 的质量风险，同时最大的模型也最受 KV 缓存显存之苦，收益最大。</p>\n<p>到 Llama 3，Meta 把 GQA 推到了全系（8B 也用），说明经过一代验证后信心已足够把它用到小模型上。这条「从大模型试水、向小模型铺开」的采用轨迹，几乎所有厂商都走过一遍，是消融法则在产业尺度上的复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿的分叉-mla-与-hybrid-线性注意力\">前沿的分叉：MLA 与 hybrid 线性注意力</h2><p>收敛到 8 是主流，但 2025–2026 年出现了一条重要分叉。DeepSeek 的 V2/V3 系列没有走 GQA，而是采用多头潜在注意力（MLA），用低秩压缩在相同缓存预算下换取比 GQA 更强的表达力（据 DeepSeek-V2 论文）。这条路线更复杂、更难服务，但在超大模型、超长上下文下缓存收益更极致。2025 年的 TransMLA 框架（arXiv:2502.07864）进一步证明现成的 Llama-3、Qwen-2.5、Mistral、Gemma-2 等 GQA 模型可等价转成 MLA。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第二条分叉-hybrid-线性注意力侵蚀注意力层的构成\">第二条分叉：hybrid 线性注意力侵蚀注意力层的构成</h3><p>2025 年下半年起，第二条分叉线开始动摇「整个模型都是全注意力 + GQA」的假设：hybrid 架构让线性注意力承担大部分层，只保留少数全注意力层。可核验的锚点有三个：2025 年 9 月发布的 Qwen3-Next 把门控 DeltaNet（一种线性注意力）与带输出门的全注意力层按约 3:1 交错，官方 <code>config.json</code> 的 <code>layer_types</code> 字段可直接数出这一比例；Moonshot AI 的 Kimi Linear（arXiv:2510.26692，2025 年 10 月）同样以约 3:1 混合 Kimi Delta Attention（KDA）层与 MLA 层；更早的 MiniMax-01（arXiv:2501.08313，2025 年 1 月）已把 softmax 注意力压到约七分之一的比例。这些比例数字以各自官方发布为准，后续代际可能调整，但「少数全注意力层 + 多数线性层」的结构取向在 2026 年已被多家旗舰采纳。</p>\n<p>这对 GQA 意味着两层变化。其一，在被保留下来的少数全注意力层内部，「少存几份 K/V」的逻辑依然成立——无论那里最终配的是 GQA 还是 MLA（Kimi Linear 选了后者），GQA 在这一层的地位并未被动摇。其二也是更根本的：KV 缓存的大头节省不再来自「层内共享 K/V 头」，而来自「整层换成无需逐 token 缓存 K/V 的线性注意力」——全注意力层的缓存随序列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 线性增长，而线性注意力层只维护与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 无关的固定大小循环状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，这正是它们能整层砍掉缓存的数学根源。换言之，GQA 仍是全注意力层内的默认解，但「全注意力层本身占几成」已成为一个新的设计旋钮；2026 年的旗舰级发布里，「纯全注意力」与「hybrid 线性混合」已是真实的选型分歧点，而非纸面概念。</p>\n<p>所以 2026 年的图景是三条线并进：GQA 是全注意力层内无处不在的稳健默认；MLA 是追求极致的前沿选项；hybrid 线性注意力则从层数构成上侵蚀全注意力的地盘，并已进入 Qwen、Moonshot 的旗舰级发布。对绝大多数团队，GQA 仍是首选——简单、内核成熟、质量已验证；只有在 KV 缓存成为绝对瓶颈、且愿意承担实现复杂度时，MLA 或 hybrid 路线才进入视野。选型的完整判断见 <a href=\"gqa-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>用 <code>num_attention_heads</code> / <code>num_key_value_heads</code> 两字段即可定位采用全注意力模型的方案：2026 年旗舰开源模型的<strong>全注意力层</strong>仍几乎全是 GQA，但 MLA 与 hybrid 线性注意力架构已构成不可忽略的另两极。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv}=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 是跨厂商独立收敛的落点：Llama 2/3、Mistral、Mixtral 皆然，因约束交集狭窄，8 近乎唯一解。</li>\n<li>组大小普遍落在 4–8（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q=64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 时为 8，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q=32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span> 时为 4），与消融法则一致；MoE 模型的注意力同样用 GQA。</li>\n<li>GQA 首落地于 Llama 2 70B 而非小模型，印证「大模型对共享更不敏感、收益更大」，后随信心增长向小模型铺开。</li>\n<li>前沿两条分叉：DeepSeek 用 MLA 低秩压缩换更强表达力；Qwen3-Next、Kimi Linear 等 hybrid 架构用线性注意力取代约四分之三的层。GQA 仍是全注意力层内的稳健默认，但「全注意力层占几成」已成新的选型旋钮。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../mechanism/group-dimensions\">分组维度选择</a> 解释为何独立收敛到 8；<a href=\"gqa-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 给出 GQA vs MLA 的选型判断。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/compression/gqa-mqa-cache\">KV 缓存优化 · GQA/MQA 与缓存</a> 从缓存角度看这些模型配置；<a href=\"../../long-context-llm-techniques/foundations/attention-complexity\">长上下文 · 注意力复杂度</a> 说明长上下文如何强化 GQA 采用动机。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主流模型采用：Llama、Mistral 与收敛的 8","id":"主流模型采用-llama-mistral-与收敛的-8"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：读配置定位注意力方案","id":"核心概念-读配置定位注意力方案"},{"level":2,"text":"真实配置数字盘点","id":"真实配置数字盘点"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么 Llama 2 70B 先动手","id":"为什么-llama-2-70b-先动手"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿的分叉：MLA 与 hybrid 线性注意力","id":"前沿的分叉-mla-与-hybrid-线性注意力"},{"level":3,"text":"第二条分叉：hybrid 线性注意力侵蚀注意力层的构成","id":"第二条分叉-hybrid-线性注意力侵蚀注意力层的构成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"部署与内核：让共享真正落成更快的服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/grouped-query-attention/practice/gqa-deployment"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：什么时候用 GQA、什么时候不用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/grouped-query-attention/practice/gqa-in-practice"}}